    {
      "id": "ledger-notes",
      "kind": {
        "text": "Established on the `cas-certificate` route, in the geometry family. This fact and F:geometry-centroid-divides-medians are deliberately adjacent and share their hypotheses character for character; the only difference is what is concluded, and that difference is exactly what makes a non-degeneracy condition necessary in one and not the other. That is the shape of the trap this corpus is built to expose.",
